1
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:41,750
[Episode 27]

2
00:01:42,459 --> 00:01:43,959
How is the paperwork for

3
00:01:43,959 --> 00:01:46,079
studying abroad coming along?

4
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:51,159
Once it's ready,
send it to the agency right away.

5
00:01:51,159 --> 00:01:53,159
Let them handle it.

6
00:01:53,159 --> 00:01:54,719
Dad.

7
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:01,000
There's something I want to discuss with you.

8
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,760
What is it?

9
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,920
I think...

10
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:07,640
maybe I don't have to study abroad.

11
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:11,039
Why did you change your mind again?

12
00:02:11,039 --> 00:02:12,879
Back then,

13
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:15,879
I didn't know what I really wanted to do.

14
00:02:15,879 --> 00:02:17,520
I saw others going abroad,

15
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:19,159
so I thought I'd give it a try too.

16
00:02:19,159 --> 00:02:20,960
But this past year's experience

17
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:22,879
has really changed my perspective.

18
00:02:22,879 --> 00:02:24,319
Right now,

19
00:02:24,319 --> 00:02:27,319
I want to go to university here at home.

20
00:02:27,319 --> 00:02:29,400
Based on my estimated scores,

21
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:31,520
I should be able to get into Qingbei.

22
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:34,560
I can always go abroad later

23
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,599
if I still want to study more

24
00:02:36,599 --> 00:02:39,085
after university.

25
00:02:43,639 --> 00:02:46,206
You studying abroad was your mother's wish

26
00:02:46,206 --> 00:02:48,360
before she passed.

27
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,960
By doing this,

28
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:52,280
you're failing her expectations.
Do you understand?

29
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:55,080
If Mom were still here,

30
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:57,919
she'd support me no matter what.

31
00:02:57,919 --> 00:03:00,120
Qing Ye.

32
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:01,879
You're not a child anymore.

33
00:03:01,879 --> 00:03:04,319
This matter concerns your entire future.

34
00:03:04,319 --> 00:03:06,599
Think it over carefully before we talk again.

35
00:03:06,599 --> 00:03:07,840
I've thought it through.

36
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:09,759
I'm going to Qingbei University.

37
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:23,360
<i>Auntie.</i>

38
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:25,280
<i>Grandma.</i>

39
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:27,520
<i>How are you all doing?</i>

40
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,919
<i>Xing Wu.</i>

41
00:03:30,599 --> 00:03:32,719
<i>How are you doing?</i>

42
00:03:46,439 --> 00:03:48,240
Grandma.

43
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:50,120
[Tomb of Zhou Gui Mei]
I've come to see you.

44
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:21,360
<i>Grandma.</i>

45
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:23,600
<i>I've come to see you too.</i>

46
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,600
<i>Why are you here?</i>

47
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:33,160
<i>Auntie said</i>

48
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:35,600
<i>that after Gaokao,</i>

49
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,920
<i>you've been here almost every day.</i>

50
00:04:40,519 --> 00:04:42,399
<i>Didn't I tell her</i>

51
00:04:42,399 --> 00:04:44,720
<i>not to tell you?</i>

52
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:47,319
<i>But I want to keep Grandma company too.</i>

53
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:52,439
<i>Grandma lived for over 70 years.</i>

54
00:04:52,439 --> 00:04:54,959
<i>I only knew her for less than a year.</i>

55
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:01,319
<i>I used to think</i>

56
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:04,160
<i>Grandma would never go away.</i>

57
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:06,519
<i>She would be here forever.</i>

58
00:05:06,519 --> 00:05:08,560
<i>Whenever I came home,</i>

59
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:11,000
<i>she would be in the courtyard</i>

60
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,000
<i>or in the room,</i>

61
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,680
<i>watching TV,</i>

62
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:16,360
<i>or knitting.</i>

63
00:05:21,199 --> 00:05:24,040
<i>Isn't that</i>

64
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:27,439
<i>the best proof that she was with us?</i>

65
00:05:27,439 --> 00:05:29,839
<i>As long as we remember her forever,</i>

66
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:34,200
<i>she will never really leave.</i>

67
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:43,120
Wu.

68
00:05:43,759 --> 00:05:45,079
Wu.

69
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:47,680
Wu. Wake up, Wu.

70
00:05:49,879 --> 00:05:51,040
You're finally awake.

71
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:52,519
Auntie Li was worried about you,

72
00:05:52,519 --> 00:05:54,439
so she asked us to check on you.

73
00:05:55,519 --> 00:05:57,199
What are you looking for?

74
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,639
Nothing.

75
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,240
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

76
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,920
We're leaving now, Grandma.

77
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,560
We're leaving, Grandma.

78
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:15,360
Bye, Grandma.

79
00:06:33,759 --> 00:06:36,600
[Examination Results Notice]
Wu, the Gaokao results are out.

80
00:06:40,959 --> 00:06:42,240
How did you guys do?

81
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:43,920
I did okay.

82
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:46,040
I'll definitely get into a university.

83
00:06:48,319 --> 00:06:50,319
What about Shi Min?

84
00:06:50,319 --> 00:06:51,519
She...

85
00:06:51,519 --> 00:06:53,000
She did well on the art exam,

86
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:55,079
and her academic score passed too.

87
00:06:55,079 --> 00:06:58,800
She wants to study design
at a teachers' college.

88
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:01,399
I'm thinking of going to
the same college as her.

89
00:07:01,399 --> 00:07:03,587
I could become a teacher too in the future.

90
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:08,026
I didn't even get half of Hu's score.

91
00:07:08,959 --> 00:07:11,665
Wu, what are your plans?

92
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,519
Me?

93
00:07:15,759 --> 00:07:17,560
I haven't figured it out.

94
00:07:20,319 --> 00:07:21,779
I-I wonder

95
00:07:21,779 --> 00:07:24,399
how Qing Ye did on the exam.

96
00:07:24,399 --> 00:07:26,519
Why worry about that?

97
00:07:26,519 --> 00:07:29,879
Maybe she's already on a plane going abroad.

98
00:07:29,879 --> 00:07:31,399
Right.

99
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,560
Wu.

100
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:39,759
Do you think

101
00:07:39,759 --> 00:07:42,519
we'll ever see Qing Ye again?

102
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,120
<i>When you need me,</i>

103
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,679
<i>tap the back of your phone three times,</i>

104
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:43,960
<i>I'll get your location right away.</i>

105
00:09:03,976 --> 00:09:06,262
[Distance: 808 km to Qingbei University]

106
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,440
<i>Xing Wu.</i>

107
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,759
<i>My name</i>

108
00:09:10,759 --> 00:09:13,360
<i>actually has another meaning.</i>

109
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:16,000
<i>Sunny days (Qing Ye) must come.</i>

110
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:18,399
<i>Rainy days must come.</i>

111
00:09:18,399 --> 00:09:19,960
<i>It means</i>

112
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:22,279
<i>rain or shine,</i>

113
00:09:22,279 --> 00:09:24,320
<i>I'll wait for you.</i>

114
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:26,440
<i>And you will keep the date.</i>

115
00:09:34,639 --> 00:09:36,879
<i>I've decided to stay in Beijing.</i>

116
00:09:36,879 --> 00:09:39,399
<i>I applied for Qingbei University.</i>

117
00:09:40,519 --> 00:09:43,159
<i>I've cut the distance</i>

118
00:09:43,159 --> 00:09:45,080
<i>between us in half.</i>

119
00:09:45,759 --> 00:09:47,960
<i>As for the other half,</i>

120
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:49,759
<i>I'll leave it to you.</i>

121
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,919
Do you still have the books?

122
00:09:55,919 --> 00:09:57,279
Yeah.

123
00:09:57,279 --> 00:09:59,246
I'm going to repeat my senior year.

124
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:03,000
What did you say?

125
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,639
Repeat my senior year.

126
00:10:04,639 --> 00:10:06,879
- Are you serious?
- For real?

127
00:10:41,679 --> 00:10:43,519
Qing Ye!

128
00:10:44,759 --> 00:10:47,080
I will catch up to you!

129
00:11:06,639 --> 00:11:08,360
<i>Human life</i>

130
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:10,399
<i>is like a rushing flood.</i>

131
00:11:10,399 --> 00:11:12,200
<i>Without rocks and reefs,</i>

132
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:14,679
<i>there are no beautiful waves.</i>

133
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:43,840
Qing Ye, Ms. Zhu wants to see you.

134
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,279
Okay.

135
00:11:53,799 --> 00:11:55,879
Ms. Zhu, you wanted to see me?

136
00:11:55,879 --> 00:11:58,159
Qing Ye, you did a great job
on the last project.

137
00:11:58,159 --> 00:12:00,200
You really hit the jackpot.

138
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:02,559
The IRR significantly
exceeded the expected threshold.

139
00:12:02,559 --> 00:12:03,960
The board members are very pleased.

140
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:05,480
Now, whenever they hear Qing Ye's name

141
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:06,720
their eyes light up.

142
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:08,120
Thank you, Ms. Zhu.

143
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:10,399
Thanks to your support and decisions,

144
00:12:10,399 --> 00:12:13,240
my project went smoothly.

145
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:14,960
Cut it out.

146
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:17,840
Take a look at this.

147
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:19,399
For this Lithium Era project,

148
00:12:19,399 --> 00:12:22,000
everyone in the company
is fighting tooth and nail for it.

149
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:24,120
But I still want to give this project to you.

150
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:26,399
So? Do you have the determination
to take on this tough nut?

151
00:12:26,399 --> 00:12:28,840
New energy projects are indeed very popular.

152
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:30,600
Many people are vying for them.

153
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:32,240
But I'm not that interested.

154
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:35,159
I'd like to ask you for another case instead.

155
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:40,254
I think Sea Ranch is an untapped treasure.

156
00:12:40,254 --> 00:12:41,759
There might be a surprise.

157
00:12:41,759 --> 00:12:44,879
You're passing up the new energy gold mine

158
00:12:44,879 --> 00:12:47,159
to go farm fish by the sea?

159
00:12:47,159 --> 00:12:49,679
You've got a unique way of thinking.

160
00:12:49,679 --> 00:12:51,080
Well, tell me about it.

161
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:53,159
What kind of potential

162
00:12:53,159 --> 00:12:55,000
do you see in this?

163
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:56,440
I think

164
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:59,799
agricultural assistance is both
business and public service.

165
00:12:59,799 --> 00:13:02,120
If we combine it with concepts

166
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,759
like marine ranching and blue granary,

167
00:13:03,759 --> 00:13:05,193
we might get support

168
00:13:05,193 --> 00:13:06,935
from research and policy sectors.

169
00:13:06,935 --> 00:13:08,320
The main thing is,

170
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:10,840
I have experience
living in a seaside fishing village.

171
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:11,919
So I'm confident

172
00:13:11,919 --> 00:13:13,960
that I can make this project a success.

173
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:17,960
An Americano.

174
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,560
Thanks.

175
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:23,720
I've been wondering,
with so many good projects out there,

176
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:26,520
why are you so interested in
agricultural assistance for seafood?

177
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:30,251
Maybe it's because I lived
in Zhazhating for a while.

178
00:13:30,251 --> 00:13:32,720
I have a special bond with it.

179
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:34,040
A special bond?

180
00:13:34,040 --> 00:13:35,360
Yes.

181
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:38,320
Is it about that person
you've been waiting for?

182
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:39,679
Zhazhating...

183
00:13:39,679 --> 00:13:41,776
The name sounds more like

184
00:13:41,776 --> 00:13:42,879
"Stab-Your-Heart-ing."

185
00:13:42,879 --> 00:13:44,360
I'm talking about the project.

186
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:46,919
Why are you changing the subject?

187
00:13:46,919 --> 00:13:48,400
You're really something.

188
00:13:48,400 --> 00:13:51,176
Usually, you don't get to lead a project
until two or three years after graduation.

189
00:13:51,176 --> 00:13:53,880
Your career is taking off like a rocket.

190
00:13:53,880 --> 00:13:55,759
I guess I've just been lucky.

191
00:13:55,759 --> 00:13:58,200
It just happens that Ms. Zhu Ying
is my senior from school,

192
00:13:58,200 --> 00:14:00,422
and she's willing to mentor me.

193
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:03,360
<i>I happen to be in a meeting near your office.</i>

194
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:05,252
<i>Want to grab some hot pot tonight?</i>

195
00:14:05,252 --> 00:14:07,120
<i>This client is so hard to deal with.</i>

196
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:08,159
<i>I'm exhausted.</i>
[Lamb Hot Pot]

197
00:14:08,159 --> 00:14:09,200
I'm working late tonight.

198
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:11,240
Mr. Meng is still being so attentive.

199
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:12,440
Stop it.

200
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:14,440
We're just friends.
I don't feel that way about him.

201
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:15,559
But he feels that way about you.

202
00:14:15,559 --> 00:14:17,960
He's been into you since college.

203
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:19,840
Actually he's quite devoted.

204
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:21,200
Even while abroad, he never forgot you.

205
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:23,600
Way better than the guys
in our finance industry.

206
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:25,639
You seem to know a lot. What? Been hurt before?

207
00:14:25,639 --> 00:14:28,445
Stop it. Don't change the subject.

208
00:14:28,445 --> 00:14:30,120
That "first love" of yours is impressive.

209
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:31,879
Who is he, anyway?

210
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,759
The client.

211
00:14:37,759 --> 00:14:40,559
The exclusivity period for these
IP derivative rights is three years.

212
00:14:40,559 --> 00:14:42,799
- We must be clear about the scope.
- Got it.

213
00:14:42,799 --> 00:14:44,080
They're doing blind boxes now.

214
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:46,600
If it goes viral
and they expand into other categories,

215
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:48,200
we have priority investment rights.

216
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:49,879
Okay, got it.

217
00:14:49,879 --> 00:14:52,320
Are there any other issues?

218
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:54,039
Nothing else for now.

219
00:14:54,039 --> 00:14:55,679
Let's proceed with this.

220
00:14:55,679 --> 00:14:58,000
Send it to Ms. Zhu for confirmation,
then send it to Jessy.

221
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:59,759
Okay, no problem.

222
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:08,280
Qing Ye,

223
00:15:08,280 --> 00:15:10,559
do you want to go for
Japanese food after work?

224
00:15:10,559 --> 00:15:12,919
A new Japanese restaurant
just opened near the office.

225
00:15:12,919 --> 00:15:15,440
I heard the ingredients are flown in.

226
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:16,519
Sorry.

227
00:15:16,519 --> 00:15:17,600
I have to work late today.

228
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:19,559
I still need to prepare the contract.

229
00:15:19,559 --> 00:15:20,600
I thought you just

230
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:22,320
finished reviewing the contract.

231
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:24,632
Is there something else to do?

232
00:15:24,632 --> 00:15:26,320
There are some minor details

233
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:28,962
I need to double-check carefully.

234
00:15:28,962 --> 00:15:30,320
Maybe another day.

235
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,960
Another day, then.

236
00:15:35,120 --> 00:15:37,360
Dad, I'm already in my twenties.

237
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:40,080
You really don't have to pick me up.

238
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:43,519
- Here.
- I'm not busy right now.

239
00:15:43,519 --> 00:15:46,159
If I don't pick you up,
I won't see you once a month.

240
00:15:46,159 --> 00:15:47,879
Have some water.

241
00:15:47,879 --> 00:15:49,159
Look at you.

242
00:15:49,159 --> 00:15:51,759
A young woman, insisting on living alone.

243
00:15:51,759 --> 00:15:52,919
So empty and lonely.

244
00:15:52,919 --> 00:15:54,720
It's not as lively as living at home.

245
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:56,726
This is my own choice.

246
00:15:56,726 --> 00:15:58,749
How many times have I told you

247
00:15:58,749 --> 00:16:00,480
to come work for the family company?

248
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:01,679
But you just wouldn't listen.

249
00:16:01,679 --> 00:16:04,000
You insisted on gaining experience elsewhere.

250
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:06,720
It's been a year now.
Haven't you had enough experience?

251
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:08,399
Not even close.

252
00:16:08,399 --> 00:16:10,919
I never liked construction in the first place.

253
00:16:10,919 --> 00:16:13,400
What I'm doing now is a job I chose for myself.

254
00:16:13,400 --> 00:16:15,240
It's something I'm passionate about.

255
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:18,159
I can learn so many things from it.

256
00:16:18,159 --> 00:16:20,559
You should be supporting me.

257
00:16:24,799 --> 00:16:28,000
- Is this your new project?
- Yes.

258
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:30,360
Agricultural assistance...

259
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:32,519
This looks like pretty tough work.

260
00:16:32,519 --> 00:16:34,039
So what?

261
00:16:34,039 --> 00:16:35,759
What's the point of being young

262
00:16:35,759 --> 00:16:37,879
if I don't push myself?

263
00:16:37,879 --> 00:16:39,960
I'm not afraid of tough work.

264
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:42,879
At critical moments, you can't rely on others.

265
00:16:42,879 --> 00:16:44,399
You have to rely on yourself.

266
00:16:44,399 --> 00:16:47,000
Rui Hang mentioned it to me
while we were playing golf.

267
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:50,000
He said you're in your twenties,
the prime time to work hard.

268
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:52,360
Next time we play golf,
why don't you come along?

269
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:53,799
You guys go ahead.

270
00:16:53,799 --> 00:16:55,039
Why drag me into it?

271
00:16:55,039 --> 00:16:57,159
After all these years, don't I know

272
00:16:57,159 --> 00:16:58,679
what are you up to?

273
00:16:58,679 --> 00:17:00,200
I'm not interested in him.

274
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,519
Well, as for you young folks,

275
00:17:01,519 --> 00:17:03,320
I don't want to interfere too much.

276
00:17:03,320 --> 00:17:05,200
Regardless of what others think,

277
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:07,559
you should make your own decisions.

278
00:17:07,559 --> 00:17:10,437
I only hope that you
take good care of yourself.

279
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:14,960
Don't worry.

280
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:16,684
I know what I'm doing.

281
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:19,279
I must say,

282
00:17:19,279 --> 00:17:20,920
the legal counsel from Creation Tech

283
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:22,200
is quite punctual.

284
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:23,519
They even arrived early.

285
00:17:23,519 --> 00:17:27,160
It seems they take this
agricultural assistance project very seriously.

286
00:17:27,160 --> 00:17:29,298
- Let's make the most of it.
- Okay.

287
00:17:31,839 --> 00:17:33,920
Hello, I'm from the inv--

288
00:17:46,559 --> 00:17:48,477
What are you doing here?

289
00:17:49,559 --> 00:17:53,000
Hello, I'm Meng Rui Hang from Yueteng Law Firm.

290
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:55,799
We are in full charge of the legal consulting

291
00:17:55,799 --> 00:17:57,880
for Creation Tech's agricultural project.

292
00:17:58,519 --> 00:18:00,240
Counsel Meng.

293
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:02,439
Do you two know each other?

294
00:18:02,439 --> 00:18:03,759
We grew up together.

295
00:18:03,759 --> 00:18:04,839
How could we not?

296
00:18:04,839 --> 00:18:06,640
That's great.
It's easier to work with friends.

297
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:08,720
We'll be more efficient too.

298
00:18:08,720 --> 00:18:10,359
I think so too.

299
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:12,799
Time is tight and there's a lot to do.

300
00:18:12,799 --> 00:18:14,599
Let's get straight to it.

301
00:18:14,599 --> 00:18:16,039
Okay.

302
00:18:20,126 --> 00:18:21,359
Regarding the contract terms

303
00:18:21,359 --> 00:18:23,200
for Creation Tech's agricultural project,

304
00:18:23,200 --> 00:18:25,680
we've sent you the preliminary draft.

305
00:18:42,200 --> 00:18:44,600
I'll drive you back.

306
00:18:45,226 --> 00:18:46,240
No need.

307
00:18:46,240 --> 00:18:47,799
I have my car.

308
00:18:47,799 --> 00:18:50,423
I could use a change of pace anyway.

309
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:53,319
Alright then.

310
00:18:53,319 --> 00:18:55,559
- I'm off. Bye.
- Bye.

311
00:18:57,880 --> 00:18:59,400
Qing Ye.

312
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:05,279
Honestly,

313
00:19:05,279 --> 00:19:07,519
if you're willing to wait,

314
00:19:07,519 --> 00:19:09,519
I can keep waiting too.

315
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:17,559
Have you ever thought,

316
00:19:17,559 --> 00:19:19,680
what if he never comes back?

317
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:23,960
I believe he will.

318
00:19:37,359 --> 00:19:38,720
<i>Xing Wu.</i>

319
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:40,440
<i>I believe in you.</i>

320
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:42,279
<i>As long as you want to go,</i>

321
00:19:42,279 --> 00:19:44,640
<i>you'll find 100 ways.</i>

322
00:19:45,359 --> 00:19:47,880
<i>If you want to see me again,</i>

323
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:51,960
<i>then come to me yourself.</i>

324
00:19:52,799 --> 00:19:54,359
<i>Okay.</i>

325
00:19:55,240 --> 00:19:56,839
<i>I promise you.</i>

326
00:19:58,839 --> 00:20:00,400
<i>Qing Ye.</i>

327
00:20:01,079 --> 00:20:03,200
<i>Just keep moving forward.</i>

328
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:06,119
<i>I'll catch up with you.</i>

329
00:20:29,279 --> 00:20:31,319
Fa Cai, Bai Ban.

330
00:20:31,319 --> 00:20:33,599
You must be hungry.

331
00:20:33,599 --> 00:20:35,039
Here.

332
00:20:57,359 --> 00:20:58,799
<i>Xing Wu.</i>

333
00:20:58,799 --> 00:21:00,920
<i>Five years have passed.</i>

334
00:21:00,920 --> 00:21:04,119
<i>A lot of things are different now.</i>

335
00:21:04,119 --> 00:21:06,880
<i>But some things remain the same.</i>

336
00:21:07,600 --> 00:21:11,920
<i>I've been moving forward all these years.</i>

337
00:21:11,920 --> 00:21:14,400
<i>You said you'd catch up with me.</i>

338
00:21:15,440 --> 00:21:18,720
<i>I often can't help but wonder</i>

339
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:20,799
<i>where you are now,</i>

340
00:21:20,799 --> 00:21:22,839
<i>and how far you've come.</i>

341
00:22:12,799 --> 00:22:15,400
<i>Qing Ye, Hu and I are
getting married next week.</i>

342
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:16,680
<i>It's in Zhazhating.</i>

343
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:18,640
<i>You must come.</i>

344
00:22:19,279 --> 00:22:21,200
<i>Can you make it?</i>

345
00:22:34,400 --> 00:22:37,519
<i>Say cheese!</i>

346
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:44,200
<i>Congratulations.</i>

347
00:22:44,200 --> 00:22:46,079
<i>You finally made it.</i>

348
00:22:46,079 --> 00:22:47,359
<i>Don't worry, Min Min.</i>

349
00:22:47,359 --> 00:22:49,119
<i>I'll definitely be there.</i>

350
00:22:55,599 --> 00:22:57,119
Hello?

351
00:22:57,119 --> 00:22:59,279
I'm going back to Zhazhating.

352
00:22:59,279 --> 00:23:01,000
Can you help me look after

353
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:02,440
Fa Cai and Bai Ban?

354
00:23:02,440 --> 00:23:04,039
<i>Why are you going back?</i>

355
00:23:04,039 --> 00:23:06,280
To attend a wedding.

356
00:23:06,280 --> 00:23:08,519
<i>Are you going to a wedding,</i>

357
00:23:08,519 --> 00:23:10,600
<i>or to reunite with an old flame?</i>

358
00:23:10,600 --> 00:23:12,800
Just take good care of them.

359
00:23:12,800 --> 00:23:14,599
Stop prying.

360
00:23:14,599 --> 00:23:16,240
Hanging up.

361
00:23:45,328 --> 00:23:49,888
[Zhazhating]

362
00:23:54,777 --> 00:23:56,637
[Zhuang's Health Clinic]

363
00:25:02,759 --> 00:25:04,599
- Auntie!
- Ye!

364
00:25:04,599 --> 00:25:06,759
Auntie Shan Xi, Auntie Yu Fen.

365
00:25:06,759 --> 00:25:08,759
Grandma, Dr. Zhuang, Uncle Pocky.

366
00:25:08,759 --> 00:25:11,119
- Hello, Qing.
- Hello.

367
00:25:11,119 --> 00:25:12,519
Give me a hug.

368
00:25:12,519 --> 00:25:14,160
Our Ye is back!

369
00:25:14,160 --> 00:25:17,039
- She is even prettier.
- Yes, exactly.

370
00:25:17,720 --> 00:25:19,759
I want a hug too.

371
00:25:19,759 --> 00:25:21,079
You're even prettier, Ye.

372
00:25:21,079 --> 00:25:23,400
- So pretty.
- Missed you so much.

373
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:25,119
- These are for you two.
- You brought gifts?

374
00:25:25,119 --> 00:25:26,960
- Thank you, thank you.
- You're home now.

375
00:25:26,960 --> 00:25:29,079
You didn't need to bring anything.

376
00:25:29,079 --> 00:25:30,720
It's been so long since we last met.

377
00:25:30,720 --> 00:25:32,559
I had to bring something back.

378
00:25:32,559 --> 00:25:34,160
- Come take a look inside.
- Okay.

379
00:25:34,160 --> 00:25:35,759
It's different from five years ago.

380
00:25:35,759 --> 00:25:38,000
See you at the wedding later.

381
00:25:38,000 --> 00:25:40,000
The changes are huge.

382
00:25:40,000 --> 00:25:41,400
- Ye.
- Come on.

383
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:42,839
Quick, have some wedding candy.

384
00:25:42,839 --> 00:25:44,160
- Thanks.
- Share the cheer.

385
00:25:44,160 --> 00:25:46,119
- That's too much.
- Year after year.

386
00:25:46,119 --> 00:25:48,400
Take more, take some more.

387
00:25:53,920 --> 00:25:55,519
This has become a living room.

388
00:25:55,519 --> 00:25:58,519
- Where's Liu Nian?
- Liu Nian is busy doing perms.

389
00:25:58,519 --> 00:26:01,119
- Then...
- I've opened a branch

390
00:26:01,119 --> 00:26:02,720
in the county now.

391
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:04,880
That's where my main business is.

392
00:26:04,880 --> 00:26:05,880
But here,

393
00:26:05,880 --> 00:26:07,039
I've kept one styling chair

394
00:26:07,039 --> 00:26:10,319
just to serve our neighbors in Zhazhating.

395
00:26:10,319 --> 00:26:12,839
No wonder. That explains it.

396
00:26:12,839 --> 00:26:14,559
Ye, you have no idea.

397
00:26:14,559 --> 00:26:17,200
If you want your auntie to do your hair now,

398
00:26:17,200 --> 00:26:19,400
you have to book in advance.

399
00:26:19,400 --> 00:26:21,720
Xuan Island is now a famous

400
00:26:21,720 --> 00:26:23,319
viral shop in Anzi County.

401
00:26:23,319 --> 00:26:25,160
And your auntie is a well-known

402
00:26:25,160 --> 00:26:27,737
updo hairstylist in the county.

403
00:26:27,737 --> 00:26:28,759
Li Lan Fang.

404
00:26:28,759 --> 00:26:29,839
What "Li Lan Fang"?

405
00:26:29,839 --> 00:26:32,275
- How many times have I told you?
- What is it again?

406
00:26:32,275 --> 00:26:35,000
[Xuan Island Barbershop]
Lan Fang Lee. Lan Fang Lee.

407
00:26:35,000 --> 00:26:37,200
So fancy, Auntie.

408
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:39,279
And I'm also doing livestreams now.

409
00:26:39,279 --> 00:26:41,395
I don't have many followers,

410
00:26:41,395 --> 00:26:42,759
only about 50,000.

411
00:26:42,759 --> 00:26:44,279
But every time I go live,

412
00:26:44,279 --> 00:26:46,720
there are a few hundred people watching me.

413
00:26:46,720 --> 00:26:48,920
Shi Min's bridal hair today

414
00:26:48,920 --> 00:26:50,240
was styled by your auntie.

415
00:26:50,240 --> 00:26:51,759
It looks really beautiful.

416
00:26:51,759 --> 00:26:53,119
Anyway, you two chat.

417
00:26:53,119 --> 00:26:54,799
I'll go help with the arrangements.

418
00:26:54,799 --> 00:26:56,200
My honey can't manage it all alone.

419
00:26:56,200 --> 00:26:57,240
- Sure. No problem.
- Go ahead.

420
00:26:57,240 --> 00:26:58,319
See you later.

421
00:26:58,319 --> 00:26:59,640
- See you later.
- Alright.

422
00:26:59,640 --> 00:27:02,279
- Give me a shout if you need anything.
- Okay.

423
00:27:02,279 --> 00:27:03,359
The women of Zhazhating

424
00:27:03,359 --> 00:27:04,880
are really career-driven.

425
00:27:04,880 --> 00:27:07,039
Looks like I need to step it up too.

426
00:27:45,559 --> 00:27:47,119
Grandma,

427
00:27:47,119 --> 00:27:49,640
I am back.

428
00:27:50,640 --> 00:27:53,400
I didn't get to see you one last time.

429
00:27:55,839 --> 00:27:57,920
Please forgive me.

430
00:28:30,279 --> 00:28:32,039
Come here, sweetie.

431
00:28:33,400 --> 00:28:34,960
Auntie,

432
00:28:34,960 --> 00:28:37,839
when did you plant so many flowers?

433
00:28:37,839 --> 00:28:39,720
Just tell me, aren't they beautiful?

434
00:28:39,720 --> 00:28:40,759
They're beautiful.

435
00:28:40,759 --> 00:28:42,400
I think they're beautiful too.

436
00:28:42,400 --> 00:28:45,238
Every time I see them,
it puts me in a great mood.

437
00:28:45,238 --> 00:28:46,279
I like flowers.

438
00:28:46,279 --> 00:28:48,400
I want to grow them myself,

439
00:28:48,400 --> 00:28:50,400
but I don't have the time.

440
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:52,400
I'm also quite careless.

441
00:28:52,400 --> 00:28:54,200
So these flowers

442
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:56,643
are all thanks to our neighbors.

443
00:28:56,643 --> 00:28:58,000
They help me take care of them.

444
00:28:58,000 --> 00:28:59,319
They water them

445
00:28:59,319 --> 00:29:01,640
and fertilize them for me.

446
00:29:01,640 --> 00:29:02,759
That's why I say

447
00:29:02,759 --> 00:29:06,000
the neighbors in Zhazhating are just wonderful.

448
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:09,359
We help and look out for each other.

449
00:29:12,319 --> 00:29:14,000
Auntie,

450
00:29:14,960 --> 00:29:17,920
what's it like upstairs now?

451
00:29:17,920 --> 00:29:19,920
I want to go take a look.

452
00:29:31,319 --> 00:29:34,751
It's just like what we talked about back then.

453
00:29:34,751 --> 00:29:37,088
This place has become so cozy.

454
00:29:37,088 --> 00:29:40,345
This is all from Wu's thoughtfulness.

455
00:29:41,440 --> 00:29:43,519
And take a look at that.

456
00:29:43,519 --> 00:29:45,039
What is that?

457
00:29:45,039 --> 00:29:46,178
The Welwitschia.

458
00:29:46,178 --> 00:29:48,960
I thought the fire had burned it away.

459
00:29:48,960 --> 00:29:52,120
The fire did burn away a lot of things.

460
00:29:52,120 --> 00:29:54,359
But when Wu found it,

461
00:29:54,359 --> 00:29:56,440
it had actually sprouted.

462
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:59,559
So he dug it out
and transplanted it into a pot.

463
00:29:59,559 --> 00:30:00,960
In his spare time, he even

464
00:30:00,960 --> 00:30:02,640
learned about plant nurseries.

465
00:30:02,640 --> 00:30:04,440
After a year of careful nursing,

466
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:06,119
he really brought it back to life.

467
00:30:06,119 --> 00:30:08,599
And it's only getting better.

468
00:30:08,599 --> 00:30:09,839
Wu even told me

469
00:30:09,839 --> 00:30:11,720
that when the time comes for you two to meet,

470
00:30:11,720 --> 00:30:13,480
he'll give it to you.

471
00:30:14,240 --> 00:30:17,400
We even installed a fresh air system

472
00:30:17,400 --> 00:30:18,839
in this room.

473
00:30:18,839 --> 00:30:20,200
It has so many functions.

474
00:30:20,200 --> 00:30:22,599
And Wu... Look at that wardrobe.

475
00:30:22,599 --> 00:30:24,096
I suggested buying one,

476
00:30:24,096 --> 00:30:25,960
but Wu refused.
He insisted on building it himself.

477
00:30:25,960 --> 00:30:27,119
I said, "Fine, fine."

478
00:30:27,119 --> 00:30:28,119
"Alright, alright."

479
00:30:28,119 --> 00:30:29,519
And this full-length mirror...

480
00:30:29,519 --> 00:30:31,465
He made that himself too.

481
00:30:32,799 --> 00:30:34,799
Rebuilding Xuan Island

482
00:30:34,799 --> 00:30:36,159
must have taken a lot of

483
00:30:36,159 --> 00:30:38,272
thought and effort.

484
00:30:38,880 --> 00:30:39,880
I was fine.

485
00:30:39,880 --> 00:30:41,519
I was busy with work.

486
00:30:41,519 --> 00:30:42,839
All the thought and effort

487
00:30:42,839 --> 00:30:45,240
was put in by Wu.

488
00:30:48,839 --> 00:30:51,279
<i>We will definitely rebuild</i>

489
00:30:51,279 --> 00:30:52,759
<i>a better home.</i>

490
00:30:52,759 --> 00:30:55,079
<i>This home will definitely be</i>

491
00:30:55,079 --> 00:30:56,839
<i>even cozier.</i>

492
00:30:56,839 --> 00:30:57,920
<i>Of course.</i>

493
00:30:57,920 --> 00:30:59,880
When the time comes, your wardrobe

494
00:30:59,880 --> 00:31:00,880
and full-length mirror...

495
00:31:00,880 --> 00:31:03,519
I'll build you even bigger ones.

496
00:31:03,519 --> 00:31:05,279
Don't forget to install an AC.

497
00:31:05,279 --> 00:31:07,379
Not a secondhand one this time.
Install a new one.

498
00:31:07,379 --> 00:31:08,680
Where to hang the family photo?

499
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:11,599
In the bedroom. Hang one in every bedroom.

500
00:31:20,040 --> 00:31:21,283
Even though this house

501
00:31:21,283 --> 00:31:22,960
was rebuilt by Wu,

502
00:31:22,960 --> 00:31:25,960
he actually hasn't lived here much.

503
00:31:25,960 --> 00:31:28,759
He only comes back to Zhazhating
a few times a year.

504
00:31:28,759 --> 00:31:30,119
When he was repeating his senior year,

505
00:31:30,119 --> 00:31:33,720
his teacher said he studied
like his life depended on it.

506
00:31:33,720 --> 00:31:35,519
Then he got into college,

507
00:31:35,519 --> 00:31:37,200
but it was so far away.

508
00:31:37,200 --> 00:31:39,519
It's such a hassle making the trip back.

509
00:31:41,200 --> 00:31:43,119
So, Xing Wu...

510
00:31:43,119 --> 00:31:45,175
How is he doing now?

511
00:31:45,920 --> 00:31:48,519
Don't you two... keep in touch?

512
00:31:51,039 --> 00:31:52,519
We...

513
00:31:52,519 --> 00:31:53,680
We

514
00:31:53,680 --> 00:31:55,590
haven't really stayed in touch.

515
00:31:57,492 --> 00:31:58,895
That Xing Wu, honestly...

516
00:31:58,895 --> 00:32:00,519
I told him

517
00:32:00,519 --> 00:32:02,720
to keep in touch with you more.

518
00:32:02,720 --> 00:32:04,600
He promised he would,

519
00:32:04,600 --> 00:32:06,720
but it turns out he didn't listen at all.

520
00:32:06,720 --> 00:32:09,400
Unbelievable.

521
00:32:09,400 --> 00:32:11,640
Auntie, everyone's busy

522
00:32:11,640 --> 00:32:12,759
in college.

523
00:32:12,759 --> 00:32:14,279
Really.

524
00:32:15,692 --> 00:32:17,519
You're still making excuses for him?

525
00:32:17,519 --> 00:32:19,000
He'll definitely come back this time.

526
00:32:19,000 --> 00:32:20,240
When I see him,

527
00:32:20,240 --> 00:32:22,480
I'll give him a piece of my mind.

528
00:32:22,480 --> 00:32:25,160
I'll chew him out on your behalf.

529
00:32:28,319 --> 00:32:29,680
Now, let's talk about you.

530
00:32:29,680 --> 00:32:31,319
What about me?

531
00:32:32,559 --> 00:32:34,160
You know...

532
00:32:36,599 --> 00:32:38,830
Are you dating anyone?

533
00:32:38,830 --> 00:32:40,160
No.

534
00:32:40,160 --> 00:32:41,240
How can that be?

535
00:32:41,240 --> 00:32:42,519
Don't lie to me.

536
00:32:42,519 --> 00:32:44,160
You're so pretty and amazing.

537
00:32:44,160 --> 00:32:46,079
Don't you have a boyfriend?

538
00:32:46,079 --> 00:32:47,720
I really don't.

539
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:48,880
Auntie,

540
00:32:48,880 --> 00:32:52,119
all these years,
I've been focusing on my career.

541
00:32:52,119 --> 00:32:54,200
How about this? When I have one someday,

542
00:32:54,200 --> 00:32:55,519
I'll definitely tell you.

543
00:32:55,519 --> 00:32:58,319
Okay, then you have to tell me.

544
00:32:58,319 --> 00:33:00,400
Cousin!

545
00:33:01,680 --> 00:33:03,119
Fuzz.

546
00:33:03,119 --> 00:33:06,240
Cousin!

547
00:33:06,240 --> 00:33:07,866
- Fuzz!
- Cou--

548
00:33:07,866 --> 00:33:09,240
What are you doing here?

549
00:33:09,240 --> 00:33:11,440
Hu and Shi Min asked us to pick you up.

550
00:33:11,440 --> 00:33:12,440
Let's go. Time to head out.

551
00:33:12,440 --> 00:33:13,720
Auntie Fang!

552
00:33:13,720 --> 00:33:15,240
- Coming, coming! Let's go, Auntie.
- Let's go.

553
00:33:15,240 --> 00:33:16,920
Wait for us!

554
00:33:47,960 --> 00:33:50,160
Qing Ye!

555
00:33:50,160 --> 00:33:52,200
What are you doing here?
I've been looking for you.

556
00:33:52,200 --> 00:33:54,240
Why are you two here?
Shouldn't you be greeting guests?

557
00:33:54,240 --> 00:33:56,120
It's fine. My parents are busy over there.

558
00:33:56,120 --> 00:33:58,617
Once I heard you were back,
I had to come see you.

559
00:33:58,617 --> 00:34:00,080
You look so beautiful today.

560
00:34:00,080 --> 00:34:01,839
This hair and makeup...

561
00:34:01,839 --> 00:34:03,119
- Pretty good, huh?
- You look great.

562
00:34:03,119 --> 00:34:05,079
- I missed you so much!
- Miss you!

563
00:34:05,720 --> 00:34:07,799
- Sit, sit, sit.
- What about me?

564
00:34:07,799 --> 00:34:09,360
Don't I look good today?

565
00:34:09,360 --> 00:34:10,440
- You?
- Look.

566
00:34:10,440 --> 00:34:13,199
Y-You're certainly bold with your outfit.

567
00:34:13,199 --> 00:34:14,800
What's that supposed to mean?

568
00:34:17,089 --> 00:34:19,680
If I'd known a wedding was this tiring,
I wouldn't have had one.

569
00:34:19,680 --> 00:34:22,000
It's not too late to back out now.

570
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:23,519
What did you say?

571
00:34:23,519 --> 00:34:25,880
It's too late. Way too late.

572
00:34:26,624 --> 00:34:27,920
This is great. So wonderful.

573
00:34:27,920 --> 00:34:29,000
Your dreams came true.

574
00:34:29,000 --> 00:34:30,159
You became an art teacher,

575
00:34:30,159 --> 00:34:33,152
and now you're marrying Hu.

576
00:34:33,152 --> 00:34:35,679
If you and Xing Wu hadn't...

577
00:34:38,960 --> 00:34:40,880
Never mind.

578
00:34:40,880 --> 00:34:43,039
How about you? Being a PE teacher...

579
00:34:43,039 --> 00:34:44,280
I really didn't see that coming.

580
00:34:44,280 --> 00:34:45,719
How did you know about that?

581
00:34:45,719 --> 00:34:48,239
Silly, I told her, of course.

582
00:34:49,559 --> 00:34:51,719
I guess that's the power of love.

583
00:34:51,719 --> 00:34:52,901
Qing Ye, you know what?

584
00:34:52,901 --> 00:34:54,440
The office desk he was assigned

585
00:34:54,440 --> 00:34:56,239
is the same one Mr. Zhu used back then.

586
00:34:56,239 --> 00:34:57,639
What about Mr. Zhu?

587
00:34:57,639 --> 00:34:59,119
Mr. Zhu was promoted to director.

588
00:34:59,119 --> 00:35:01,760
Now he has his own office.

589
00:35:01,760 --> 00:35:03,560
It really suits him well.

590
00:35:03,560 --> 00:35:06,325
By the way, what about Cao Fan
and Ye Ying Jian?

591
00:35:06,325 --> 00:35:08,159
Cao Fan went to Shenzhen to start a business.

592
00:35:08,159 --> 00:35:09,880
I heard she's doing quite well.

593
00:35:09,880 --> 00:35:12,840
And Ye Ying Jian went abroad.

594
00:35:12,840 --> 00:35:14,880
With... what was her name?

595
00:35:14,880 --> 00:35:16,039
Shu Han.

596
00:35:16,039 --> 00:35:18,440
Shu Han went with him.

597
00:35:19,440 --> 00:35:21,119
Cousin,

598
00:35:21,119 --> 00:35:23,880
aren't you curious about what I'm doing?

599
00:35:23,880 --> 00:35:25,239
You?

600
00:35:25,239 --> 00:35:26,599
You...

601
00:35:26,599 --> 00:35:28,679
First, you became a truck driver.

602
00:35:28,679 --> 00:35:31,600
And then you gradually built your own fleet,
becoming a boss.

603
00:35:31,600 --> 00:35:33,519
Not long ago, you bought some new trucks.

604
00:35:33,519 --> 00:35:34,662
You even know that?

605
00:35:34,662 --> 00:35:36,440
You post 800 times a day on WeChat Moments.

606
00:35:36,440 --> 00:35:39,025
It's hard for me not to know.

607
00:35:40,719 --> 00:35:43,559
Hao Cheng Gong, "Mr. Successful."

608
00:35:44,273 --> 00:35:47,239
After all,
I've been out here four years longer than you.

609
00:35:47,239 --> 00:35:50,440
But compared to Wu, I'm still small-time.

610
00:35:50,440 --> 00:35:52,695
Wu is still Zhazhating's

611
00:35:52,695 --> 00:35:54,280
most successful man.

612
00:35:54,280 --> 00:35:56,559
Qing Ye, is Xing Wu back yet?

613
00:35:56,559 --> 00:35:58,320
Has he been in touch with you?

614
00:35:58,320 --> 00:35:59,320
Yeah,

615
00:35:59,320 --> 00:36:01,159
why isn't Wu here yet?

616
00:36:09,360 --> 00:36:10,519
Now,

617
00:36:10,519 --> 00:36:13,000
please set your applause

618
00:36:13,000 --> 00:36:15,000
to deafening mode.

619
00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:18,000
Let's use our overwhelming passion

620
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:20,639
to welcome today's main couple

621
00:36:20,639 --> 00:36:21,840
to take center stage!

622
00:36:21,840 --> 00:36:23,239
Let's give a warm welcome

623
00:36:23,239 --> 00:36:26,079
to today's most dazzling bride and groom.

624
00:36:26,079 --> 00:36:27,800
Making their grand entrance!

625
00:36:27,800 --> 00:36:30,000
Bravo! Bravo!

626
00:36:30,000 --> 00:36:31,119
Bravo!

627
00:36:31,119 --> 00:36:33,599
Bravo! Bravo!

628
00:37:42,719 --> 00:37:45,599
Kiss her! Kiss her! Kiss her!

629
00:37:45,599 --> 00:37:50,280
- Kiss her! Kiss her! Kiss her!
- Kiss her! Kiss her! Kiss her!

630
00:37:50,280 --> 00:37:51,760
Where are you kissing her?

631
00:37:51,760 --> 00:37:54,719
- On the lips! On the lips! On the lips!
- On the lips! On the lips!

632
00:38:00,880 --> 00:38:02,960
Congratulations to the newlyweds!

633
00:38:02,960 --> 00:38:05,719
The ceremony is complete!

634
00:38:15,080 --> 00:38:16,960
Congratulations.

635
00:38:17,800 --> 00:38:20,079
I have something I'd like to say.

636
00:38:20,079 --> 00:38:23,079
For me, today is a very special day.

637
00:38:23,079 --> 00:38:25,639
This is the perfect time to say it.

638
00:38:25,639 --> 00:38:27,400
Here, I want to thank someone

639
00:38:27,400 --> 00:38:29,559
who is very important to me.

640
00:38:29,559 --> 00:38:31,519
Because of you,

641
00:38:31,519 --> 00:38:34,320
I went from being insecure

642
00:38:34,320 --> 00:38:35,840
to becoming brave.

643
00:38:35,840 --> 00:38:39,519
You made me willing to express
the thoughts in my heart.

644
00:38:39,519 --> 00:38:41,679
You let me know

645
00:38:41,679 --> 00:38:44,000
who I truly am.

646
00:38:44,000 --> 00:38:45,599
So,

647
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:48,119
Qing Ye,

648
00:38:52,319 --> 00:38:53,880
I want to give this bouquet to you.

649
00:38:53,880 --> 00:38:55,039
Back in our senior year,

650
00:38:55,039 --> 00:38:57,039
you coming into my life changed me completely.

651
00:38:57,039 --> 00:38:59,280
You brought me joy,

652
00:38:59,280 --> 00:39:01,760
which led to the happiness I have now.

653
00:39:01,760 --> 00:39:04,519
I am truly, truly grateful to you.

654
00:39:04,519 --> 00:39:06,519
I hope your life in the future

655
00:39:06,519 --> 00:39:08,440
will be as radiant as these flowers.

656
00:39:08,440 --> 00:39:09,600
No,

657
00:39:09,600 --> 00:39:12,071
I hope you will be even more radiant
than these flowers.

658
00:39:18,000 --> 00:39:19,599
Thank you.

659
00:39:21,400 --> 00:39:25,000
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

660
00:39:26,320 --> 00:39:28,880
You must be happy, Qing Ye.

661
00:39:34,600 --> 00:39:36,880
Come on, everyone. Cheers!

662
00:39:36,880 --> 00:39:38,000
Thank you!

663
00:39:38,000 --> 00:39:39,719
Thank you, Auntie!

664
00:39:39,719 --> 00:39:41,239
Auntie, congratulations!

665
00:39:41,239 --> 00:39:43,639
- Congratulations, Auntie!
- Thank you, thank you.

666
00:39:43,639 --> 00:39:46,000
Let's drink until we drop today!

667
00:39:47,360 --> 00:39:48,890
Qing Ye!

668
00:39:48,890 --> 00:39:50,079
What are you doing here?

669
00:39:50,079 --> 00:39:51,840
Why don't you come sit with us?

670
00:39:51,840 --> 00:39:53,427
I...

671
00:39:53,427 --> 00:39:54,760
I was just craving

672
00:39:54,760 --> 00:39:56,760
the little cakes in Zhazhating.

673
00:39:56,760 --> 00:39:57,960
Qing Ye.

674
00:39:57,960 --> 00:39:59,360
Neither of us has our phone on us.

675
00:39:59,360 --> 00:40:02,039
Can we borrow your phone to call Wu?

676
00:40:05,960 --> 00:40:08,034
Sure. Here.

677
00:40:14,302 --> 00:40:15,602
[Ms. Zhu]

678
00:40:17,870 --> 00:40:19,360
Sorry. I need to take this.

679
00:40:19,360 --> 00:40:20,639
Okay.

680
00:40:20,639 --> 00:40:22,484
Hello, Ms. Zhu.

681
00:40:22,484 --> 00:40:24,559
The client is about to blow up over here.

682
00:40:24,559 --> 00:40:25,880
You're at the helm. Without you,

683
00:40:25,880 --> 00:40:27,199
what if the ship goes off course?

684
00:40:27,199 --> 00:40:29,079
I'm sorry, Ms. Zhu. I'm still out of town.

685
00:40:29,079 --> 00:40:30,400
You're the project lead.

686
00:40:30,400 --> 00:40:32,840
The client scheduled a meeting
for 9:00 AM tomorrow.

687
00:40:32,840 --> 00:40:35,320
You must make it back to Beijing tonight.

688
00:40:52,800 --> 00:40:55,320
- He's not answering.
- Maybe he's still on the plane?

689
00:40:55,320 --> 00:40:58,000
Wait a bit longer.
He said he would come for sure.

690
00:40:59,360 --> 00:41:02,405
Shi Min, Hu, Fuzz. I'm really sorry.

691
00:41:02,405 --> 00:41:05,519
My boss says I have to be in Beijing today
for a morning meeting tomorrow.

692
00:41:05,519 --> 00:41:07,440
I think I have to catch a flight right now.

693
00:41:07,440 --> 00:41:09,360
Could you tell Auntie and the others for me?

694
00:41:09,360 --> 00:41:11,239
I won't go over and interrupt.

695
00:41:11,239 --> 00:41:12,639
Totally understand.

696
00:41:12,639 --> 00:41:14,680
Let's keep in touch on WeChat.

697
00:41:14,680 --> 00:41:16,079
See you next time.

698
00:41:16,079 --> 00:41:17,920
Give me a hug.

699
00:41:17,920 --> 00:41:18,960
Happy wedding!

700
00:41:18,960 --> 00:41:19,960
Be happy.

701
00:41:19,960 --> 00:41:22,239
Take care on your way.

702
00:41:22,239 --> 00:41:23,519
I'll head out now.

703
00:41:23,519 --> 00:41:26,217
So... you're not waiting for him?

704
00:41:26,217 --> 00:41:29,199
- Alright, go do what you need to do.
- Have a safe trip.

705
00:41:32,320 --> 00:41:34,159
That Xing Wu...

706
00:42:12,880 --> 00:42:14,840
Driver, please hurry.

707
00:42:14,840 --> 00:42:16,360
Got it.

